以下是一个使用Java的`Socket`和`ServerSocket`类实现的简单C/S通信程序。程序包括服务器端和客户端，按照题目要求实现了时间查询和退出功能。

### 服务器端代码 (`Server.java`)

```java
import java.io.*;
import java.net.*;
import java.util.Date;

public class Server {
    public static void main(String[] args) throws IOException {
        ServerSocket serverSocket = new ServerSocket(12345);
        System.out.println("服务器已启动，等待客户端连接...");

        while (true) {
            Socket socket = serverSocket.accept();
            System.out.println("客户端已连接：" + socket.getInetAddress());

            new Thread(() -> {
                try (BufferedReader in = new BufferedReader(new InputStreamReader(socket.getInputStream()));
                     PrintWriter out = new PrintWriter(socket.getOutputStream(), true)) {

                    String inputLine;
                    while ((inputLine = in.readLine()) != null) {
                        System.out.println("收到客户端消息：" + inputLine);
                        if (inputLine.endsWith("Exit")) {
                            out.println("To " + extractName(inputLine) + ": Bye");
                            break;
                        } else if (inputLine.contains("what time is it")) {
                            out.println("To " + extractName(inputLine) + ": " + new Date().toString());
                        }
                    }
                } catch (IOException e) {
                    e.printStackTrace();
                } finally {
                    try {
                        socket.close();
                    } catch (IOException e) {
                        e.printStackTrace();
                    }
                }
            }).start();
        }
    }

    private static String extractName(String message) {
        String[] parts = message.split("From \\d+ ");
        if (parts.length > 1) {
            return parts[1].split(":")[0].trim();
        }
        return "";
    }
}
```

