- Ensure `this._keys.length` on the server matches `this.keys.length` on the client.
- Initialize `this._lastKey` to `0` (or the correct starting value) on the server to align with the client's initial key (`1`).

This fix ensures the server correctly processes the client's encrypted messages without requiring client-side changes.

