Spring框架本身并没有直接提供一个工具或方法来专门处理这种按占位符顺序替换的场景。然而，你可以通过以下几种方式来实现这一功能：

### 1. **手动解析和替换**
你可以编写一个简单的工具方法来解析字符串，识别占位符，并根据占位符后的数字从数组中取出相应的值进行替换。

```java
import java.util.regex.Matcher;
import java.util.regex.Pattern;

public class PlaceholderReplacer {

    private static final Pattern PLACEHOLDER_PATTERN = Pattern.compile("\\?(\\d+)");

    public static String replacePlaceholders(String template, Object[] args) {
        Matcher matcher = PLACEHOLDER_PATTERN.matcher(template);
        StringBuffer buffer = new StringBuffer();
        while (matcher.find()) {
            int index = Integer.parseInt(matcher.group(1)) - 1;
            if (index < args.length) {
                matcher.appendReplacement(buffer, args[index].toString());
            } else {
                throw new IndexOutOfBoundsException("Index out of bounds for placeholder ?" + (index + 1));
            }
        }
        matcher.appendTail(buffer);
        return buffer.toString();
    }

    public static void main(String[] args) {
        String template = "Hello ?2, how are ?4 and ?1?";
        Object[] values = new Object[] {"Alice", "Bob", "Charlie", "David"};
        String result = replacePlaceholders(template, values);
        System.out.println(result); // 输出: Hello Bob, how are David and Alice?
    }
}
```

### 2. **使用`String.format`或`MessageFormat`**
虽然`String.format`和`MessageFormat`通常用于按位置或名称替换，但你可以通过预处理字符串，将`?1`, `?2`等转换为`%s`，然后使用`String.format`来替换。

```java
import java.util.regex.Matcher;
import java.util.regex.Pattern;

public class PlaceholderReplacer {

    private static final Pattern PLACEHOLDER_PATTERN = Pattern.compile("\\?(\\d+)");

    public static String replacePlaceholders(String template, Object[] args) {
        Matcher matcher = PLACEHOLDER_PATTERN.matcher(template);
        StringBuffer buffer = new StringBuffer();
        while (matcher.find()) {
            matcher.appendReplacement(buffer, "%s");
        }
        matcher.appendTail(buffer);
        String formattedTemplate = buffer.toString();
