Creating a Chrome extension that instantly retrieves Elon Musk's statements or opinions about a specific term or topic encountered on a webpage (e.g., Wikipedia) is an interesting and technically challenging project. Below is a step-by-step guide to designing and implementing such an extension, along with security considerations to ensure the tool is safe and privacy-respecting.

